 "summary": "The PR implements roadmap SmallXAndSaturation \u00a70.6 (\"Quadrupoles and higher correlators\") directly \u2014 the general 2n-point correlator, the quadrupole, the coincidence limits `Q U x y y w = S U x w` and `Q U x x z w = S U z w`, and `|Q| \u2264 1` \u2014 all of which \u00a70.6 lists under \"To prove\". Its prerequisite \u00a70.3 (the dipole operator) is on main in `QFT/SmallX/Dipole/Operator.lean`, placement under `Dipole/` matches the roadmap's stated layout, and the two shared lemmas added to `UnitaryTrace.lean` are consumed by the new file, so the touched dipole proofs are part of the same topic rather than a bundled refactor.",
